              "id": "ca453-u5c23-q1",
              "difficulty": "SUPER-HARD",
              "type": "mcq",
              "question": "What is the exact output of this C code snippet?\nint a = 5;\nint b = ++a + a++ + --a;\nprintf(\"%d, %d\", a, b);",
